WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:08.360
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls to summon forth Aqua Regina-sama.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.410
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.700
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.380
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.310
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:09.880
Are you sure you want to be dropped off here?

00:02:10.030 --> 00:02:13.090
Yes. We're going to buy something from the convenience store.

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:15.420
Thank you very much for giving us a ride.

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:20.440
Nah. I should be the one thanking you all for helping me clean up the shop.

00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.220
Maki-san, you don't have to thank them.

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:26.610
These two talked more than they worked.

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:29.250
That's mean, Kaito!

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:35.100
How about you and all the time you spent eating Maki-san's delicious snacks.

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:36.380
Well...

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:38.060
Don't start arguing.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.600
You were a great help to me for coming over.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.540
Well then, I will see if I can help out tomorrow, too.

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:47.140
Okay, Kaito. I'll be counting on you.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.620
Good night, Maki-san.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:53.590
Hey...

00:02:54.950 --> 00:02:56.290
Did you hear something?

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.500
It's the sound of the waves, right?

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.640
It's cold, so I'm going back.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:05.550
No, that's definitely not the sound of the sea.

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:08.910
Lucia, the sound seems to come from that direction.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:18.420
It came out!!

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.800
The Whereabouts of Tears.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.750
Hey, Hanon. Let's go back.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.270
If a ghost really appeared, what are you going to do?

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.790
Keep quiet, Lucia.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:41.190
Since this is a rare chance, I will take a photo as proof, and then send it to the television station.

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:44.420
But, can ghosts be photographed with a camera?

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.770
You're really stupid, Lucia.

00:03:45.770 --> 00:03:48.210
Haven't you heard of ghost photography?

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:50.780
That shows ghosts can actually be photographed.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.120
Oh, I see.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:54.810
It's the crying again.

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:56.780
I can hear the crying.

00:03:58.480 --> 00:03:59.800
Don't, Lucia!

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.180
If you open the door suddenly, the ghost might become frightened and run away.

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:05.900
I see.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.040
Lucia. Over here, over here.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:10.770
There's a window.

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:13.220
We can see what's in the shack through that...

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.680
It's no use. I can't reach up there at all.

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.650
Then, I guess one of us must become a stool to stand on.

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:22.680
Me!?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:25.800
No way! You were the one who wanted to come here.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.060
So you should be the one doing it.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.160
Eh!?

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.830
Guess we don't have a choice.

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.330
This boils down to using our abilities to decide, Lucia.

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.820
Deciding using our abilities?

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:44.250
Lucia and Hanon's favorite food, taiyaki, was selling dirt cheap, so I bought a ton of them.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.910
If I bring these to those two, they'll be really happy.

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:52.240
It's Lucia and Hanon.

00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:53.920
What are they doing there?

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.650
Let's go, Lucia.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.100
Okay, Hanon.

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.730
Don't cheat.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.140
Starting with the stone...

00:05:00.140 --> 00:05:01.550
Rock-paper-scissors!

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:02.550
Hey!

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.140
Rina.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.930
What happened to the two of you?

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:12.260
It's Rina's loss!

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:17.160
What did I do to deserve this?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.150
Whatever. Calm down and don't move.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.660
Ah, over there.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.770
Hanon, it really is a ghost.

00:05:29.770 --> 00:05:31.600
Alright, leave this to me.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.080
I'll take a picture of it.

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:35.660
What are the two of you doing?

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.670
If this continues, the taiyaki I bought will be cold.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.960
What are you doing!?

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:46.900
Go away, you robber crab.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.120
OWW!!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.560
Let go! Come on, let go!

00:05:56.820 --> 00:05:59.510
I'm sorry. Are you both alright?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.440
Somehow...

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:03.260
Looks like I'm alright.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:06.980
Ah, Hanon!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.770
The ghost is running away!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.590
I won't let you get away!

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.360
Please run away, Yuuri-san!

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.130
B-But...

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.320
Don't say any more, leave this to me.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.630
Run away, quickly!

00:06:21.630 --> 00:06:23.310
Yes, Hippo-san.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.190
Hippo.

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:31.740
Yuuri-san didn't commit any sins.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.820
Please blame me if you want to.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:45.120
Running out in the middle of the night, and meeting up with one of the water demons.

00:06:45.120 --> 00:06:47.370
This is a terrible crime.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.500
In the Mermaid Kingdom, they would have put him on trial.

00:06:49.770 --> 00:06:53.490
Taki-san, putting it as a crime is too much.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:54.420
That's right.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:58.630
Hippo only likes the water demon called Yuuri.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:02.360
No, it's better that nothing develops.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:09.410
If that water demon is planning something by getting close to Hippo, we won't be able to deal with it.

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:12.010
When that time comes, it will be too late.

00:07:12.980 --> 00:07:17.190
I think there is no choice but to let Hippo reflect in his room for awhile.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:21.320
Yeah. He should give up on that water demon.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:26.270
But Yuuri was crying.

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.700
I don't think those tears were fake.

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:36.670
Yuuri-san...

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.000
Hippo-san...

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:52.490
Good morning, Hippo.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.350
We brought you your breakfast.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.980
Today's menu is your favourite food, fluffy fluffy omelet rice and grilled bacon!

00:08:05.980 --> 00:08:09.860
With a fresh crispy salad on the side and freshly squeezed orange juice!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:16.250
Here, eat up!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.470
I don't have an appetite.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:24.030
Hippo. You didn't eat your dinner yesterday either, right?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:27.060
If you don't eat a little, it'll be bad on your body.

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:30.100
It's alright, I don't care what happens to me.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:31.070
Hippo.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:34.350
I know that I'm the one at fault.

00:08:34.350 --> 00:08:39.900
I'm the one who is responsible for your safety, and to actually fall in love with Yuuri-san, a water demon...

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:43.250
But, I love her. I want to be with her.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:46.200
I'm unable to stop these feelings of mine.

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:51.580
Even when everyone found out about it, I still wanted to be with Yuuri-san.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.300
I can't help but to do so.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:58.720
I couldn't stand by my mission nor give happiness to the girl I love.

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:00.660
I... I...

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.150
Don't, Hippo!

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.270
What are we going to do if get hurt!?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:11.080
It's alright, this way I'll feel better!

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.940
A person like me... A person like me...

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.870
Yuuri, so you were here.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.120
We were looking for you for a while ago.

00:09:29.430 --> 00:09:32.030
Don't tell me you are slacking off!

00:09:32.030 --> 00:09:37.670
But, if you were thinking up a plan for outdoing the Black Beauty Sisters, then I guess I'll forgive you.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:42.240
I'm sorry. I'm not feeling very well.

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:43.770
I shall excuse myself.

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:47.580
Huh? Yuuri doesn't look well.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.430
What happened to her?

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:50.380
She's been acting strange lately.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:54.730
Going out every night, but after she returns, she keeps crying non-stop.

00:09:54.730 --> 00:09:57.650
Could it be she is hiding a secret from us!?

00:09:58.920 --> 00:10:00.770
Hiding a secret...

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:10.660
The night when I first met Yuuri-san was a beautiful moonlit night just like this.

00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:13.740
Yuuri-san, I want to meet you!

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.410
Yuuri-san!!

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:20.140
L-Lucia-san...

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:23.260
What are you doing over there!?

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.610
Hippo, answer me honestly.

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:30.080
You haven't give up on Yuuri, right?

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:33.290
No. She is the love of my life.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:35.600
Alright, Hippo.

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.220
I have received your feelings.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:43.120
Lucia-san, even if you received my feelings, what exactly are you going to do?

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:45.230
I'm going to help you run away with Yuuri!

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.860
Run away!?

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.330
It doesn't matter if it's the moonlight of the skies or the moonlight of the seas.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.630
I can't reach out and touch it.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.010
Hippo-san...

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.940
Huh? You are...

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:28.160
A letter for me?

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:34.790
If you still love me, then let's run away together.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:37.350
I shall wait for you at the shack tonight.

00:11:37.350 --> 00:11:38.310
Love, Hippo.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:39.830
Hippo-san...

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.770
That Yuuri.

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:48.630
To hide from us that she's secretly keeping in contact with the Mermaid Princesses' dolphin.

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.200
What exactly is she doing!?

00:11:50.200 --> 00:11:55.790
While we're dealing with the Black Beauty Sisters, she's going to go and take the credit herself.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.150
I'll definitely not let that happen.

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.870
We won't be fooled that easily.

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:03.450
As if we'll let her do as she wishes.

00:12:09.870 --> 00:12:12.640
Hippo, I brought your dinner.

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:15.230
Hippo.

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.620
Oh no! Everyone, Hippo disappeared!

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:26.380
If Yuuri really likes you, she'll read the letter Momo-chan brought to her and wait for you at that shack.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.340
But if I'm really going to run away, you're going to get punished.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:35.740
If you're going to give up on your love because she's the enemy, won't that be heartbreaking?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.280
Lucia-san...

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:42.980
Karen.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:47.520
I knew that the water demon Yuuri was meeting someone every night lately.

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:49.730
But I didn't think it would be Hippo.

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:55.190
Even after reading the letter Momo-chan brought, I still can't believe it.

00:12:55.190 --> 00:12:59.370
That suitcase. You aren't planning to run away with Yuuri, right?

00:13:00.490 --> 00:13:02.910
Karen, hear me out. There is a reason behind this.

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:06.790
Lucia, could you have forgotten Hippo's mission?

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.760
To allow peace to return to the seas,

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:14.220
his mission is to protect us, the Mermaid Princesses, as we try to summon Aqua Regina-sama.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:18.390
But, Hippo and Yuuri really love each other.

00:13:19.070 --> 00:13:23.780
If we break them up, they won't be able to live on.

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:27.810
Even if the sea rages and a lot of mermaids end up suffering...

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:30.360
Are you saying that it's alright as long they're happy?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.040
If that's what you want, then go.

00:13:34.650 --> 00:13:35.970
I won't stop you anymore.

00:13:35.970 --> 00:13:37.560
Karen, you blockhead!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:38.830
It's fine, Hippo.

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:39.810
Let's go.

00:13:40.440 --> 00:13:41.010
But...

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:44.800
I'll always support you, no matter who'll try to stop us.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.990
Come on. Yuuri is waiting for you.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.250
Hurry up, Hippo.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.190
Yes, Lucia-san.

00:13:52.420 --> 00:13:53.670
She's really foolish.

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:01.850
Yuuri-san.

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:04.000
Hippo-san.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:10.450
I'm really happy to have received the letter.

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.620
So, I've come with a resolution.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:16.630
For Hippo-san, I won't have any regrets, even if I have to abandon everything.

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:19.390
Yuuri-san, I feel the same way.

00:14:19.390 --> 00:14:22.390
I'm sure there is a place in this world where we can live together.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.550
Yes, Hippo-san.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:31.460
That's great, Hippo.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:33.040
You attained happiness.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:48.100
Hippo!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:51.650
Yuuri!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:57.010
Taking all the credit for yourself...

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:58.650
That won't happen so easily, Yuuri.

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:02.210
Maria and Izul. Eril, too.

00:15:02.220 --> 00:15:03.130
Why are you all here?

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:10.510
We saw you were acting strange, so we thought you were hiding something from us, and we followed you.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:14.420
A plan to use this young guy to lure out the Mermaid Princesses, right?

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.070
Why would the water demons be here?

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:22.150
The Pink Pearl Mermaid Princess appeared so quickly.

00:15:22.150 --> 00:15:23.380
Amazing, Yuuri.

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:24.220
You succeeded.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:27.610
No, it isn't like that!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:28.750
Yuuri-san...

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:31.260
Hippo-san, it isn't like that.

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:32.570
Please believe me!

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:35.110
I really love you, Hippo-san.

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.950
What are you complaining about!?

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.190
Lovers' Ice Darts!

00:15:39.810 --> 00:15:42.640
Maria, what are you doing to Hippo-san!?

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.400
Stop that!

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:46.040
Shut up! Get out of the way!

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:49.620
Yuuri-san!

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:53.630
Hippo, leave this to me and run away with Yuuri.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:56.750
No way, I can't leave Lucia-san alone here...

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.570
I want you to attain happiness.

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.920
Because you are my important friend!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.580
Lucia-san...

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:07.790
His mission is to protect us, the Mermaid Princesses. Have you forgotten that?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:11.930
Even if the sea rages and a lot of mermaids end up suffering...

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:14.650
Are you saying that it's alright as long they're happy?

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:19.890
I... I was only thinking about myself.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:25.580
Abandoning my friends, to run away with Yuuri-san.

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:27.830
Watch out!

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.040
Hippo!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:37.020
If you want to save him, listen to us and...

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:37.950
be captured!

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:40.490
Hanon.

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:41.450
Karen.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:41.890
Rina.

00:16:42.130 --> 00:16:43.770
Blue Pearl.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:45.120
Green Pearl.

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:48.100
And even the Purple Pearl Mermaid Princess...

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:50.270
Why are all of you here?

00:16:50.680 --> 00:16:53.100
Because we heard Hippo ran away.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:56.890
So we guessed he must have gone to the shack, and we rushed over there.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:17:00.230
And then, they met me when I was going back.

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.110
Alright, with this, we won't lose to them.

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:10.620
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.750
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.720
Green Pearl Voice!

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:16.250
Purple Pearl Voice!

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:29.930
Pichi Pichitto Punishment Live Start!

00:18:44.580 --> 00:18:46.710
Love Shower Pitch!

00:18:47.540 --> 00:18:50.340
No! As we thought, it always ends like this.

00:18:50.870 --> 00:18:52.290
How about an encore?

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:54.870
An encore!?

00:18:54.870 --> 00:18:56.190
I've had enough!

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.880
Hippo! Hippo!

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:00.590
Wake up, Hippo!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:03.770
Hippo, are you alright?

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:04.700
Get a hold of yourself.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:09.280
Yes, I-I'm alright.

00:19:09.280 --> 00:19:10.070
Yuuri-san.

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:15.510
Hippo-san.

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.520
I'm sorry, Hippo-san.

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:22.370
I didn't think it would turn out like this.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:25.400
But I really didn't lie to you.

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:28.380
Please believe me. Hippo-san...

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:31.690
Hippo-san...

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.130
I don't want to hear any more of your excuses.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:39.800
Lying to me, and then the matter of luring out the Mermaid Princesses...

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:41.600
You're a really frightening person.

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:45.270
Hippo-san, what are you saying?

00:19:45.730 --> 00:19:48.300
I don't want to see your face again!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:50.080
Don't appear in front of me again!

00:19:51.590 --> 00:19:52.490
Hippo-san.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.570
What are you saying, Hippo?

00:19:54.570 --> 00:19:56.080
What exactly happened to you!?

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.230
Hippo!

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.980
Goodbye, Yuuri-san.

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.060
I don't think we'll see each other again.

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:08.000
Hippo!

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:09.270
Hold it right there.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:10.620
Karen.

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:13.040
Actually, Hippo already knows the truth.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:16.370
That Yuuri didn't betray him.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.370
Then, why!?

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:20.840
He decided to give up this relationship.

00:20:21.500 --> 00:20:22.210
Why!?

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.610
Because he doesn't want to bring unhappiness to us.

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.150
Yuuri-san...

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:35.090
Umm...

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:38.540
Everybody, I have a favor to ask.

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:45.500
Please tell Hippo-san that I won't appear in front of him again.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.100
And that he can be relieved.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:48.810
Yuuri.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:55.090
If I continue to love Hippo-san, something like what happened today is going to happen again.

00:20:55.680 --> 00:21:01.060
Because I like him, I don't want to trouble him anymore.

00:21:01.060 --> 00:21:01.980
So...

00:21:02.380 --> 00:21:04.150
Y-Yuuri-san...

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:10.110
I decided this because I like him.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:23.310
Yuuri...

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:32.120
Hippo, are you fine with this?

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:34.640
It's okay.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:38.450
But Hippo, this is the love of your life, right?

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:40.480
Are you really going to give up on her?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.710
No, I won't give up!

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:45.010
I can't forget about her.

00:21:45.010 --> 00:21:46.330
Then, why!?

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:50.870
That's why I'm going to seal away these feelings!

00:21:51.340 --> 00:21:53.050
Seal these feelings...

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:53.800
Hippo.

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:00.740
Good bye, Hippo-san.

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:03.140
Good bye, Yuuri-san.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:09.560
Putting myself in their shoes, to give up on their love no matter what.

00:22:09.560 --> 00:22:11.710
That's... Something like that is...

00:23:51.180 --> 00:23:52.980
Look, look here, Lucia.

00:23:53.090 --> 00:23:55.360
A good-looking guy skateboarding event?

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:57.880
Geez, Hanon... Guess it can't be helped.

00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:02.010
Alright, since it's decided, let's go to this event!

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:03.800
Hanon, that's old.

00:24:04.240 --> 00:24:06.100
Why is Tarou-chan over there?

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:07.120
It's true.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:09.620
Who is the girl with him?

00:24:09.620 --> 00:24:13.920
Could she be the Mermaid Princess that Tarou-chan can't forget?

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:16.820
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:16.820 --> 00:24:18.010
Song of Suspicion.

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:19.270
How about an encore?
